WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.870
I have a question for you, Rina-san.

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:06.420
Were you pressured into your sudden transfer?

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.670
No.  It was my own decision.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.670
Page 18
Bugs have it too good, don't they? 
They shut themselves inside 
their shells, yet they're still claustrophobic.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:17.010
How do you feel about your transfer to M&M Music?

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.030
I don't think of them as a rival.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.800
Does it have anything to do with your family situation?

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.050
Are you aware that there are rumors that this transfer has to do with money?

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.610
It's being literally described as "selling yourself"...

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.560
About that, please ask Ogata-san instead.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.990
Aren't you also... Ogata-san, if I remember correctly?

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.750
We're grown tired of each other.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.430
Feel free to report that.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.860
We have the same face, the same voice,

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.660
and the same questions.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.500
That's the impression we gave to everyone, is it not?

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.870
Well then, I have a question for President Kanzaki.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:58.160
How does it feel to acquire someone who was your rival up until now?

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.300
Since she's part of us now, terms such as "allies" and "rivals" no longer make sense, right?

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.410
The former rivalry no longer exists.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.530
What?

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.020
What do you mean?

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.520
It's almost time to move, everyone.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.850
Wait, answer our questions just a little longer-

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.680
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.680
Sleep, for now

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:30.590
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:30.590
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.600
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.600
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:57.120
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:57.120
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:04.820
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:04.820
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:13.700
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:13.700
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:21.590
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:21.590
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:27.210
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:27.210
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:31.700
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:31.700
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.030
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.030
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.250
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.250
I don't mind losing anything else

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:45.780
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:45.780
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.240
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.240
Find the real me

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:55.320
zutto matteru

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:55.320
I'll be waiting forever

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.420
Why did she go to M3?

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.820
What is she thinking?  Is she an idiot?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.140
Oh well, whatever.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.970
Ogata Productions will do fine with just Yuki,

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:10.290
and Ogata Rina won't be able to sell any more of her records and she'll die of hunger on the roadside or something.

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:12.020
What are you going to do?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:12.560
Eh?

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:14.970
Rina-chan left.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:17.440
Is Aesop going to follow her and transfer, too?

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.620
W-What?

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.590
Stop it, don't look at me like that...

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.950
W-Wait!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.740
Fujii-

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.840
...san.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:37.780
I'll be right there.

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:39.340
Yes.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.350
Of course we're doing it, it will all go as planned.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:46.950
Oh.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:47.750
Hello.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:49.690
Geez.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.880
In the very end, you're the one who's victorious.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:57.020
All I wanted was to settle this quickly, within this week.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.400
Doesn't tomorrow fall under your range?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.050
Tomorrow's the weekend, as well as an unlucky day.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.020
That doesn't suit you.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.680
Kanzaki-san.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:08.540
With this, the costs for the painting are covered, yes?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.770
That depends on how Rina fares.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:14.150
Or... should I say that it depends on how our Menou fares.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.130
This coming album will be great.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.820
They lodged together during New Year's,

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.470
and wrote all the songs within a week.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.890
I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.190
That's right.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.140
Thank you for the studio too, Ei-chan.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.010
If, this time,

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.750
things don't go so well for Menou,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.030
then we'll have to rely on Rina-chan to clean up the mess as much as possible.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.290
Please take care of my sister.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:40.380
She's in good hands.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.060
You're late.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.250
Menou-san.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.710
If someone were to capture that pose of yours in a photograph-

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.060
Dinner, dinner.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.100
Let's dig in.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.220
I haven't visited him yet.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.310
I figured I'd wait for you first.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:23.960
Ah.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.020
I'm sorry, if you told me I would've-

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:31.060
But you had work today, didn't you?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.340
Ah, yeah.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:35.210
I came after it was over.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.100
I thought that if you had some time we could wait for a little...

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:43.030
Is it fine if the two of us talk for a while?

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.080
You wanted to talk?

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:55.410
Yes.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.120
Rina-chan-

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.120
Venus-

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.600
You first, Touya-kun.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.000
I saw on the TV.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.120
Rina-chan's-

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.820
Really?

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.250
Must've been... quite a shock.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:12.920
Yeah.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.070
And to go to M3, of all places!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.490
That's not very nice of Ogata-san.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.400
It's not some punishment game either.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.110
Rina-chan said she wanted to become independent.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.880
Really?

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.470
Being all by herself was too painful for her.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:35.060
Allowing her to leave was an act of Ogata-san's kindness.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.810
I guess.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:38.580
That can't be right

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.600
What should I do?

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.550
Hey, what do you think I should do?

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.580
Well...

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.700
I don't think Rina-chan can go on any longer.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.590
Is there anything we can do about it?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.240
Anything we can do, huh...

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:57.590
Since it's already been publicly announced, there's... nothing we can do about it.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.650
I know that, but...

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.100
Yuki...

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.410
Rina-chan's not going to be around anymore!

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:08.250
She'll be in M&M Music starting next week!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.910
Ah... I'm sorry.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:18.140
I understand that you're worried.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.600
But, no matter where Rina-chan goes,

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.330
she can only get more and more amazing.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:31.100
Even though she's amazing the way she is already...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.770
Why am I...

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:37.830
What is it?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.830
Say it

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:43.250
Say it

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:43.440
Yuki

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.360
I guess I'm just lonely.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.610
That must be it.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.070
Are you free tomorrow?

00:07:56.320 --> 00:08:00.040
Rina-chan will be at a recording for a TV programme.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.260
It's her final job at Ogata Productions.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.600
Would you like to go and support her together?

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.670
T-Tomorrow...

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.130
doesn't work for me.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.280
Akira asked me to take his shift at Echoes,

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.840
since he has a date with Misaki-san or something,

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.430
then I have to visit my dad...

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.980
I see.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.100
I guess so.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:26.640
Plus, Rina-chan and I have nothing to do with each other anymore.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:29.620
I mean, I was originally hired just for that concert anyway.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.020
Okay.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:34.590
All right, I'll go by myself...

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:35.780
Ah!

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:39.570
I actually can't, I forgot...

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:44.140
I have to go and meet the producer from Touou Television...

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.060
Is this for the Venus Festival?

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.560
So you know, Touya-kun?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.990
Yeah, Yayoi-san told me.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.780
Oops

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.780
Oh, really?

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.050
She didn't tell you?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.800
She said it once while she was driving me around...

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:04.420
So, you're really participating in the Venus Festival...

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.210
I don't really know.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.900
Rina-chan

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.130
There's no way that'll happen.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:08.900
she already

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:08.900
Because...

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:12.150
I don't mind if I don't participate.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.830
Yuki...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.380
I don't want to participate.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:17.780
It's still too soon.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.810
I have to go.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.840
Let me just say hello to Touya's dad...

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:03.390
Why are you avoiding me?

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.570
I'm not avoiding you...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.810
With my dad in this state, this isn't the time to be doing <i>that</i>...

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:14.740
I don't understand what your father's condition has to do with your relationship with me.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.910
What?!

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.030
It's good that Yuki doesn't know.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:24.020
Even going down to hell and back ten times wouldn't atone for your betrayal of your father.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.830
But, you...

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:27.690
You...

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.140
What about me?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.550
Fujii-san.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:36.470
What you should be doing,

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:41.180
is letting Yuki know the fact that Rina-san will no longer be around,

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:46.730
as well as telling her exactly who it is that Rina-san needs the most right now.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.280
That's all.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.060
You can't do it?

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.460
You, who can't even do that...

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.580
...will only be fine if you do this.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.220
Forget it all.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:07.160
Your father, Yuki-san, everyone.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.630
I'll have to go soon.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.950
Touya-kun should be coming shortly.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.940
Please take a seat before Touya comes.

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:48.060
Something terrible will probably happen to you very soon.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.730
Perhaps I'll tell Touya this.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:59.650
I know that you are waiting.

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:02.300
I understand, but...

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.130
As I get older,

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:08.430
when you spend days in darkness bedridden like this,

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:12.100
you lose your ability to endure and to think straight...

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:15.940
Touya-kun...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.070
If he can remember...

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.170
that would be enough.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:26.230
But if he doesn't remember even with that, then...

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:29.030
I'll leave it for when the time comes.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.910
He might leave you; do you know that?

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.960
When the time comes...

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.180
I'll fall in love with him all over again.

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:49.120
Don't say things that makes my heart race like that.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.610
I'm sorry!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.490
Sakura-dan Disbandment ceremony

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.420
Since there doesn't seem to be any questions...

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:48.450
In that case, may I ask the representative of the group, group leader Ayako-san, to say a few words.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:56.250
From today onwards, the Sakura-dan will be disbanded.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.150
Although each of the members will return to each of our daily lives,

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.140
Please...

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.900
...don't forget us!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.120
If you see us on the streets,

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:13.000
please... say hello.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.520
Our feelings will be passed on to our vice-leader, Sarii.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:29.970
Sarii Touin, who debuts with this today,

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.360
Please take care of her.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.170
I gave a letter... to Rina-san?

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.390
No, I never gave her the letter.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:48.360
Eh?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.440
But, Rina-chan said...

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:52.570
Are you sure you didn't misunderstand?

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.810
I gave the letter to Fujii-san directly.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.140
Is that so?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.250
Thank you.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:14:59.920
No problem.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:05.650
Rina-chan said it was you who drove Fujii-kun from Echoes...

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.590
About that... yes.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.230
If that was a misunderstanding too, I wonder what I would've done.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:15.930
We're on our way, so you can rest assured.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.260
Yes.  That's... true.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:26.810
Is it possible for you to schedule me some free time tomorrow?

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:29.220
That's... not possible.

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:30.950
I guess so.

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:44.380
You've given my precious Yuki so much pain...

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.620
I have no use for someone like that.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:57.310
Where's Yuki?

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.720
I'm about to go and pick her up.

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:01.870
Tell her I said hi.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.110
Are you relieved that I'll no longer be here?

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.220
It's too early to be relieved.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.400
You can't.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.660
If the both of us abandon Yuki, she'll...

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.670
Thank you very much.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:02.500
I-I'm okay...

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:04.910
... sorry.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:12.670
I'm Morikawa Yuki.  Please take care of me.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.300
Ah, this girl is?

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.340
She's the number one focus of our production company this year.

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:22.190
Hmm... she's completely different from Rina-chan, isn't she?

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:25.640
She'll be the ace of Ogata Productions from now on.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.600
For you to even let go of your sister, it seems like you've really decided.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.030
This is because Morikawa Yuki has the potential to surpass Rina.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.940
Rina lost.

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.600
Well, shall we go?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.210
I'm Fujii of Ogata Productions.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.130
I'm Rina-san's manager.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.120
Ah, go ahead.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.080
Thank you very much.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.930
I appreciate your efforts.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:32.250
I'll go once I finish packing my things, so please drive the car over.

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.490
What is it?

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:52.700
Fujii-kun?!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.680
Why are you... is Yuki here?

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.830
I saw you on TV.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.970
Ah.

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:02.380
Well, I have nothing to do with you anymore.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.340
Am I right?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.900
I might be a nuisance, but...

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.270
You're a real nuisance.

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.810
Yuki, she...

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:13.990
Yuki asked you to come?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.700
I was going to come with her,

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:22.010
but she has an important job today,

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.170
so she couldn't come.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:24.780
So...

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.460
Heh, that Yuki... she's so helpless.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.080
She's always been a novice.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.800
I told her that there's no way we can possibly stay friends forever...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.720
Even though I told her that much...

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.950
I'll get going soon.

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.950
You seem to be fine, so I'm relieved.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.500
I'm fine.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.490
I'm Ogata Rina.  You really think I'd cry?

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.750
I never thought that in the least.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.790
Ah, I brought some cheesecake.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.420
I'm sorry it's not from Echoes though.

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:58.760
Heh, so it's not from Echoes, huh?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.340
But, thanks.  I'm glad.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:06.350
Well then.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:07.300
Yeah.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.650
What's wrong?  You're not going?

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.620
Rina-chan, are you okay?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.150
Yeah.  Why?

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:28.070
What are you doing?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:29.900
You're not okay.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.450
Are you making fun of me?

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.080
You're not okay at all.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:34.930
Let go.

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:36.040
Let go of me.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:38.260
Why, Rina-chan...

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:42.510
Why do you seem even smaller than Yuki?

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.050
Don't compare me to Yuki.

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:47.980
Now, please.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.650
I'm sorry.

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:52.770
I'll stop.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.100
Just for a little while...

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.530
...stay like this.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:03.940
Somehow, my breathing's heavy, and my heart is racing...

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.210
It feels like it's about to burst.  So...

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:07.780
Rina-chan...

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.990
Are you crying?

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:12.620
There's no way I'd cry, I won't cry.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:17.820
Thank you, I'm fine now.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.420
I'm the usual Rina now, right?

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.300
Go.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:35.390
Somebody

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:38.460
Yuki

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.460
Misaki-san

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.980
Haruka

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:40.980
Mana-chan

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.610
Anybody

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:47.570
Stop me

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:45.460
Rina-chan, I...

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.770
I have a request-

00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:53.420
Kiss me, Fujii-kun.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:56.140
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:56.140
You have always been kind to me

00:22:57.070 --> 00:23:02.710
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:57.070 --> 00:23:02.710
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:11.550
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:11.550
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:18.160
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:18.160
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:26.530
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:26.530
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:36.480
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:36.480
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:44.220
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:44.220
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:52.130
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:52.130
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:59.600
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:59.600
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:09.580
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:09.580
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:23.210
Page 19

00:24:24.240 --> 00:24:27.070
It's called moving on to the next when you're bored of the previous.

00:24:27.070 --> 00:24:28.090
Although,

00:24:28.090 --> 00:24:31.080
it usually seems like I'm already bored before I even move on.

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:32.320
White Album.
